	(text "ADP5071 values from datasheet Fig. 47 / Tables 9-11. LT3097: VOUT = 100 uA x RSET (147k = 14.7 V, +15 V is the top of its range); PGFB dividers 432k/10k trip power good near 13.3 V (also enables fast start-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
